cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Kinemorph: a browser animation studio with frame-exact video export"
message: "If you use Kinemorph in academic work, cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Momin
    given-names: Sohil
    email: sohilmomin2000@gmail.com
    affiliation: "drsamonline"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/drsamonline/kinemorph"
url: "https://drsamonline.github.io/kinemorph/"
abstract: >-
  Kinemorph is a browser animation studio built on PixiJS, React and TypeScript. A pure
  render(project, time) function drives the preview, the scrubber and a frame-by-frame
  WebCodecs export, so exported video is identical to what the editor showed.
keywords:
  - animation
  - video-export
  - webcodecs
  - pixijs
  - generative-audio
